---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, CONTACT } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles personal data and analytics.`}
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="body-sm">Last updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</p>

      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} ({SITE.domain}) is operated by Strandway Systems, based in Nova Scotia, Canada.
        For any privacy question, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>
        This is a static site. There is no account system, no signup form, no newsletter and no
        database of visitors. Personal data is collected in exactly one place:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics</strong>: aggregate usage statistics (pages viewed, approximate
          country, referring site, device type), counted by Plausible. No cookie is set, nothing is
          stored on or read from your device, and no cross-site identifier is created. The figures
          cannot be traced back to an individual, which is why no consent is asked for them.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you email me, I have your email address for as long as the conversation is useful, and
        for nothing else.
      </p>

      <h2>Legal basis</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics are cookieless and hold no personal data, so they rest on legitimate interest in
        knowing which pages are read, not on consent. Anything that would store data on your device
        runs only on consent, which you give or withhold in the banner and can change at any time
        by clearing this site's storage in your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        If you are in the EU/EEA or the UK, you have the right to access, correct, export or delete
        the personal data held about you, and to withdraw consent at any time. Email the address
        above and it will be handled.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts are served from this site's own domain, not from a font provider. Some images are
        served from a content delivery network. Analytics are handled by
        <a href="https://plausible.io/privacy" rel="noopener">Plausible</a>, an EU-hosted,
        cookieless service, as described in the <a href="/cookie-policy">cookie policy</a>.
        Affiliate partners set their own cookies only after you click an affiliate link. See the
        <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes materially, the date at the top of this page changes with it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
